0:{"buildId":"4jyhtURzJjykZZcsuxfCv","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-100 via-purple-50 to-blue-100","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-8","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/blog","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors mb-6","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1l729n",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"}],["$","path","x3x0zl",{"d":"M19 12H5"}],"$undefined"]}],"返回列表"]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"w-full h-40 md:h-48 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-400 via-pink-400 to-rose-400 mb-6 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"text-center px-6","children":["$undefined",["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white text-center px-6 drop-shadow-md","children":"冷战憋到内伤？教你一句话破冰"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"2026年8月11日"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-clock w-4 h-4","children":[["$","circle","1mglay",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["$","polyline","68esgv",{"points":"12 6 12 12 16 14"}],"$undefined"]}],2," 分钟阅读"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"bg-pink-50 text-pink-500 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs","children":"恋爱技巧"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm mb-8","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"spread":40,"glow":false,"disabled":false,"proximity":64,"inactiveZone":0.01,"borderWidth":3,"variant":"pink"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative prose prose-pink max-w-none","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 ","children":"有没有发现恋爱里的冷战，比吵架还熬人？你刷手机刷到眼酸，他窝在沙发打游戏打到没电，空气安静得能听见蚂蚁打哈欠，谁先开口谁就输了？那都是老一辈谈恋爱的老黄历了。"}],["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 ","children":"冷战本质根本不是“我不想理你”，潜台词其实是“我有点生气，我怕说出来更糟，你快来哄我一下”，硬憋的结果就是攒着攒着就变成“你根本不在乎我”，本来只是碗谁洗的小事，最后能扯到“你从一开始就不爱我”，亏不亏？"}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 ","children":"给大家分享三个零尴尬破冰干货，亲测好用："}],["$","p","3",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 bg-pink-50 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-pink-400","children":"第一，别搞情绪质问，换“需求型开口”。别上来就说“你什么时候才能不闹了”，换一句“我刚才煮了你爱吃的芋圆，起来吃一碗”，给台阶比讲道理管用一百倍，先把对话打开再说。"}],["$","p","4",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 bg-pink-50 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-pink-400","children":"第二，给对方一个“不丢面子的台阶”。如果对方是闷葫芦性格，你可以说“刚才我也有点凶，其实冷静完我就后悔了”，你退一步，他绝对不会跟你死杠到底。"}],["$","p","5",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 bg-pink-50 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-pink-400","children":"第三，约定一个冷战“停止暗号”。比如提前说好，谁先发一个猫咪捏脸的表情包，就代表停战，不用谁认错，给彼此一个台阶下。"}],["$","p","6",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 ","children":"真的，恋爱里哪有那么多输赢，赢了冷战，输了感情，那才是真的亏。"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm mb-8","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"spread":40,"glow":false,"disabled":false,"proximity":64,"inactiveZone":0.01,"borderWidth":3,"variant":"pink"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative flex items-center justify-between","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","button",null,{"className":"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-pink-100 flex items-center justify-center text-pink-500 hover:bg-pink-200 transition-colors","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2